        "original_id": "6c78905f-9335-546e-b1e2-d994cb94f661",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Florida State Road 922, Bal Harbour Shops, Haulover Park, Miami-Dade County, Broad Causeway, Collins Avenue, Atlantic Ocean, Biscayne Bay\n- Organizations: Whitman family\n- Topics: commercial corridors, mall ownership\n\nFacts:\n- Florida State Road 922 is an important commercial artery in northeastern Miami-Dade County.\n- Stores line much of Florida State Road 922, including Bal Harbour Shops near the road’s eastern terminus.\n- Bal Harbour Shops is owned by the Whitman family.\n- Bal Harbour Shops is one of the few remaining family-owned malls in the United States.\n- Haulover Park is located on a shoal between the Atlantic Ocean and Biscayne Bay.\n- Haulover Park is just north of Broad Causeway, which is Florida State Road 922, and Collins Avenue.",
